    "iCloud Drive가 활성화되어 있는지 확인해주세요. 설정 > [사용자 이름] > iCloud > iCloud Drive를 켜주세요." : {
      "comment" : "iCloud permission error message",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zkontrolujte, že je zapnutý iCloud Drive: Nastavení systému > [vaše jméno] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sørg for, at iCloud Drive er slået til: Systemindstillinger > [dit navn] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitte prüfe, ob iCloud Drive aktiviert ist: Systemeinstellungen > [Dein Name] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Βεβαιωθείτε ότι το iCloud Drive είναι ενεργό: Ρυθμίσεις συστήματος > [το όνομά σας] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please make sure iCloud Drive is enabled: System Settings > [your name] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comprueba que iCloud Drive esté activado: Ajustes del Sistema > [tu nombre] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Varmista, että iCloud Drive on päällä: Järjestelmäasetukset > [nimesi] > iCloud > iCloud Drive."
